    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lockdown 2024 is a point-and-click adventure game with a linear storyline. It is about a young man (18) who\u2019s lived a very sheltered life. His father and stepmother allowed no extracurricular activity, no internet, and no fraternizing with the opposite sex. A new strain of COVID-19 is discovered and the government has instituted a new lockdown. Our hero\u2019s father passed away during the first pandemic and now he\u2019s the only man in a house full of women. He will need to attend university (college) online, help the women around the house, and discover some secrets about his and his family\u2019s past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Over 11,000 images </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 500+ Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> All images rendered in 4k (3840x2160)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Engaging (skippable) mini-games; Lock picking, Fixing the pipes, Computer Hacking, Basketball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3 Preset Options of play style to allow you to play as you want (can be fine-tuned in-game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 50+ unlockable scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 23 separate locations to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Text translated into 9 additional languages (Machine Translation): French, Spanish, Russian, Italian, Portuguese (BR), Chinese (Simplified), Japanese, German, Hungarian.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The housemates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Indicates a relationship that is customizable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your stepmom*, Devon, is the matriarch of the house. She\u2019s very strict and sometimes overbearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150200/extras/de5cf5da28580aa33121d80edce3c869.avif?t=1745781679\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maria, your step-grandma*, is Devon\u2019s mother. She\u2019s kind and loving and serves as a teacher to our hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150200/extras/0317b2bfa64085705b489ecdcb8dd740.avif?t=1745781679\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Amber, you stepsister*, is Devon\u2019s eldest daughter. Amber is fashion conscious and more worldly than our hero. She\u2019s also really mean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150200/extras/5572b5ded909aec64be4f62a2f19788d.avif?t=1745781679\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emma, your other stepsister*, is Amber\u2019s younger sister. She\u2019s sweet and innocent and is the same age as the main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150200/extras/35b5a2d4adeab268243a747464868718.avif?t=1745781679\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jasmin is friends with Amber. She\u2019s sporty and very promiscuous. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150200/extras/5e33d2cdf151e693cf9b61a452740452.avif?t=1745781679\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Naomi is an exchange student and friends with Emma. She likes computers, cosplay, and other geeky stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150200/extras/a1e3b1929114436abb95f7818c5788c1.avif?t=1745781679\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The live-in maid Isabella starts working in the house just as the outbreak begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150200/extras/70aab4218884d9d57b670d2e7ed9965a.avif?t=1745781679\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lockdown 2024 is a point-and-click adventure game with a linear storyline. It is about a young man (18) who\u2019s lived a very sheltered life. His father and stepmother allowed no extracurricular activity, no internet, and no fraternizing with the opposite sex. A new strain of COVID-19 is discovered and the government has instituted a new lockdown. Our hero\u2019s father passed away during the first pandemic and now he\u2019s the only man in a house full of women. He will need to attend university (college) online, help the women around the house, and discover some secrets about his and his family\u2019s past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Over 11,000 images </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 500+ Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> All images rendered in 4k (3840x2160)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Engaging (skippable) mini-games; Lock picking, Fixing the pipes, Computer Hacking, Basketball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3 Preset Options of play style to allow you to play as you want (can be fine-tuned in-game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 50+ unlockable scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 23 separate locations to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Text translated into 9 additional languages (Machine Translation): French, Spanish, Russian, Italian, Portuguese (BR), Chinese (Simplified), Japanese, German, Hungarian.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The housemates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Indicates a relationship that is customizable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your stepmom*, Devon, is the matriarch of the house. She\u2019s very strict and sometimes overbearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150200/extras/de5cf5da28580aa33121d80edce3c869.avif?t=1745781679\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maria, your step-grandma*, is Devon\u2019s mother. She\u2019s kind and loving and serves as a teacher to our hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150200/extras/0317b2bfa64085705b489ecdcb8dd740.avif?t=1745781679\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Amber, you stepsister*, is Devon\u2019s eldest daughter. Amber is fashion conscious and more worldly than our hero. She\u2019s also really mean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150200/extras/5572b5ded909aec64be4f62a2f19788d.avif?t=1745781679\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emma, your other stepsister*, is Amber\u2019s younger sister. She\u2019s sweet and innocent and is the same age as the main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150200/extras/35b5a2d4adeab268243a747464868718.avif?t=1745781679\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jasmin is friends with Amber. She\u2019s sporty and very promiscuous. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150200/extras/5e33d2cdf151e693cf9b61a452740452.avif?t=1745781679\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Naomi is an exchange student and friends with Emma. She likes computers, cosplay, and other geeky stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150200/extras/a1e3b1929114436abb95f7818c5788c1.avif?t=1745781679\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The live-in maid Isabella starts working in the house just as the outbreak begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150200/extras/70aab4218884d9d57b670d2e7ed9965a.avif?t=1745781679\" /></div></p>",
